{"id":"ai-checking-answers","title":"AI: checking what AI tells you","subject":"AI prompting","label":"AI prompting","exams":[],"language":"en","seconds":174,"duration":173.55,"audio":"voice.mp3","words":474,"sections":[{"id":"hook","title":"Everyday puzzle","start":0,"end":12.955},{"id":"explain","title":"The routine","start":12.955,"end":70.245},{"id":"explain2","title":"Privacy","start":70.245,"end":83.815},{"id":"example","title":"Worked example","start":83.815,"end":101.835},{"id":"check","title":"Quick check","start":101.835,"end":111.305},{"id":"answer","title":"Answer","start":111.305,"end":124.925},{"id":"mistakes","title":"Common mistakes","start":124.925,"end":152.475},{"id":"recap","title":"Recap","start":152.475,"end":173.55}],"lines":[{"s":0,"a":0.5,"b":5.47,"text":"Have you ever asked AI a question and got a confident answer that felt completely true?","w":[0.52,0.66,0.84,1.12,1.56,2.1,2.18,3.04,3.16,3.34,3.42,3.94,4.26,4.44,4.68,5.16]},{"s":0,"a":5.92,"b":10.53,"text":"I'm Kora. Today we look at how to check what it tells you, calmly and simply.","w":[6.02,6.22,7.04,7.36,7.48,7.68,7.78,7.92,8.04,8.28,8.44,8.56,8.84,9.46,9.96,10.12]},{"s":0,"a":10.83,"b":12.53,"text":"That habit keeps you in charge.","w":[10.92,11.18,11.58,11.82,11.96,12.08]},{"s":1,"a":13.38,"b":16.2,"text":"An AI model can be wrong and still sound certain.","w":[13.44,13.68,14.1,14.48,14.64,14.8,15.24,15.42,15.7,15.98]},{"s":1,"a":16.5,"b":21.76,"text":"It may invent facts, give wrong dates or numbers, or make up quotations nobody said.","w":[16.54,16.66,16.86,17.22,18.12,18.38,18.74,19.08,19.22,19.98,20.12,20.34,20.46,21.08,21.44]},{"s":1,"a":22.06,"b":25.81,"text":"It can also point to books, articles or links that do not exist.","w":[22.14,22.22,22.5,22.82,23.08,23.22,23.78,24.32,24.5,24.76,24.94,25.1,25.3]},{"s":1,"a":26.11,"b":28.49,"text":"So you stay responsible for anything you use.","w":[26.18,26.36,26.52,26.78,27.42,27.62,27.92,28.16]},{"s":1,"a":28.79,"b":31.09,"text":"First, ask yourself how much it matters.","w":[28.84,29.58,29.78,30.14,30.3,30.5,30.6]},{"s":1,"a":31.39,"b":35.71,"text":"For health, law, money, safety, or work you will hand in, always verify.","w":[31.42,31.62,32,32.5,32.92,33.6,33.74,33.96,34.08,34.22,34.48,34.88,35.22]},{"s":1,"a":36.01,"b":39,"text":"Second, check the key facts in a trusted source.","w":[36.12,36.96,37.22,37.32,37.56,37.94,38.06,38.14,38.56]},{"s":1,"a":39.3,"b":44.13,"text":"Use a textbook, an official site, a teacher, or two independent sources that agree.","w":[39.4,39.58,39.66,40.56,40.7,41.12,41.78,41.86,42.3,42.44,42.7,43.22,43.6,43.76]},{"s":1,"a":44.43,"b":47.71,"text":"Third, ask the model to show its working step by step.","w":[44.46,45.32,45.58,45.7,46.04,46.2,46.42,46.58,46.96,47.26,47.46]},{"s":1,"a":48.01,"b":50.56,"text":"Check each step, especially in maths.","w":[48.08,48.52,48.74,49.3,50.02,50.14]},{"s":1,"a":50.86,"b":54.2,"text":"Fourth, ask for sources, then open them yourself.","w":[50.96,51.86,52.08,52.26,53.08,53.34,53.58,53.74]},{"s":1,"a":54.5,"b":56.7,"text":"A source you cannot find does not count.","w":[54.58,54.72,55.02,55.16,55.54,55.9,56.1,56.32]},{"s":1,"a":57,"b":62.12,"text":"Fifth, ask what might be wrong with this answer, or ask again in a new chat and compare.","w":[57.08,57.76,57.98,58.16,58.36,58.52,58.76,58.9,59.1,59.84,60.06,60.3,60.6,60.7,60.78,60.98,61.64,61.76]},{"s":1,"a":62.42,"b":69.82,"text":"But the model agreeing with itself is not proof. Sixth, watch for out of date information after the model's cut off date.","w":[62.44,62.6,62.8,63.22,63.62,63.8,64.36,64.5,64.74,65.66,66.54,66.84,67.06,67.2,67.3,67.58,68.3,68.5,68.6,69.02,69.26,69.44]},{"s":2,"a":70.67,"b":72.98,"text":"One more rule protects you and other people.","w":[70.84,71.02,71.26,71.52,71.96,72.26,72.44,72.64]},{"s":2,"a":73.28,"b":79.12,"text":"Do not paste passwords, identification numbers, or other people's private details into an AI chat.","w":[73.28,73.46,73.74,74.12,74.96,75.72,76.22,76.42,76.64,77,77.38,77.96,78.2,78.4,78.74]},{"s":2,"a":79.42,"b":83.39,"text":"Keep personal information out, even when the answer seems harmless.","w":[79.48,79.8,80.3,80.9,81.56,81.82,81.98,82.18,82.5,82.8]},{"s":3,"a":84.24,"b":87.83,"text":"Suppose the model says a historical event happened in a certain year.","w":[84.34,84.82,84.94,85.28,85.56,85.64,86.24,86.58,86.96,87.06,87.14,87.48]},{"s":3,"a":88.13,"b":90.41,"text":"It also gives a book title as its source.","w":[88.2,88.36,88.68,88.94,89.04,89.26,89.64,89.78,89.94]},{"s":3,"a":90.71,"b":92.05,"text":"You check an encyclopaedia.","w":[90.74,90.92,91.16,91.26]},{"s":3,"a":92.35,"b":94.9,"text":"The year is right, but the book does not exist.","w":[92.36,92.48,92.76,92.9,93.42,93.58,93.7,93.96,94.18,94.36]},{"s":3,"a":95.2,"b":99.68,"text":"So you keep the fact, cite the encyclopaedia, and drop the fake reference.","w":[95.24,95.4,95.56,95.78,95.9,96.76,97,97.14,98.3,98.46,98.76,98.9,99.16]},{"s":3,"a":99.98,"b":101.41,"text":"That is the routine in action.","w":[100,100.24,100.38,100.5,100.94,101.1]},{"s":4,"a":102.26,"b":102.95,"text":"Quick check.","w":[102.3,102.56]},{"s":4,"a":103.25,"b":106.49,"text":"An AI solves a maths problem and gives you an answer.","w":[103.3,103.54,103.98,104.34,104.42,104.72,105.5,105.66,105.88,106.02,106.18]},{"s":4,"a":106.79,"b":108.23,"text":"What are two ways to check it?","w":[106.86,107.04,107.22,107.44,107.74,107.86,108.12]},{"s":4,"a":108.68,"b":110.88,"text":"Pause here and try it. I'll wait.","w":[108.72,109.08,109.36,109.5,109.78,110.38,110.56]},{"s":5,"a":111.73,"b":115.86,"text":"You could work the problem yourself, or check each step of the model's working.","w":[111.76,111.9,112.06,112.3,112.4,112.78,113.88,114.06,114.42,114.66,114.94,115.04,115.16,115.5]},{"s":5,"a":116.16,"b":121.11,"text":"You could also put the answer back into the question, use a calculator, or compare with your textbook.","w":[116.18,116.3,116.5,116.78,116.92,117.06,117.34,117.56,117.72,117.84,118.72,118.88,118.96,119.9,120.04,120.38,120.52,120.64]},{"s":5,"a":121.41,"b":124.5,"text":"A second method catches errors the first one missed.","w":[121.48,121.62,121.98,122.48,123,123.36,123.52,123.94,124.1]},{"s":6,"a":125.35,"b":128.13,"text":"Common mistake one: copying without reading.","w":[125.42,125.82,126.4,126.92,127.38,127.74]},{"s":6,"a":128.43,"b":132.59,"text":"Read every line and restate it in your own words before you use it.","w":[128.48,128.82,129.08,129.78,129.94,130.46,130.64,130.72,130.98,131.18,131.58,131.98,132.22,132.42]},{"s":6,"a":132.89,"b":135.69,"text":"Mistake two: trusting invented references.","w":[132.96,133.4,134.02,134.52,135.02]},{"s":6,"a":135.99,"b":139.52,"text":"Open each source yourself, and drop any you cannot find.","w":[136.08,136.48,136.72,137.02,137.98,138.12,138.5,138.68,138.82,139.14]},{"s":6,"a":139.82,"b":144.99,"text":"Mistake three: asking the same chat are you sure, then treating yes as proof.","w":[139.9,140.3,141.24,141.6,141.76,142.06,142.46,142.58,142.78,143.54,143.8,144.16,144.56,144.72]},{"s":6,"a":145.29,"b":152.05,"text":"Ask a fresh question, check independently, and use a professional for health, law, money, or safety advice.","w":[145.4,145.62,145.72,146,146.82,147.1,148.06,148.3,148.46,148.54,149.1,149.28,149.92,150.52,151,151.16,151.54]},{"s":7,"a":152.9,"b":156.12,"text":"Recap: AI can sound certain and still be wrong.","w":[152.96,154.04,154.44,154.6,154.9,155.32,155.46,155.68,155.8]},{"s":7,"a":156.42,"b":160.45,"text":"Check what matters in trusted sources, and open every source yourself.","w":[156.48,156.74,156.94,157.34,157.46,157.92,158.88,159.06,159.46,159.76,160.04]},{"s":7,"a":160.75,"b":164.91,"text":"Ask for working, test the answer, and protect private details.","w":[160.86,161.12,161.3,162.04,162.38,162.58,163.3,163.44,164,164.36]},{"s":7,"a":165.21,"b":168.81,"text":"Top tip: if you cannot find the source, do not cite it.","w":[165.22,165.54,166.28,166.36,166.5,166.9,167.16,167.3,167.88,168.04,168.36,168.64]},{"s":7,"a":169.11,"b":172.95,"text":"Knowzone helps you build calm, careful habits for learning with AI.","w":[169.22,169.76,170.02,170.16,170.46,170.92,171.3,171.66,171.84,172.16,172.46]}],"scenes":[{"at":0.25,"heading":"Everyday puzzle","items":[{"at":0.4,"kind":"text","text":"Asked AI and got a confident answer?"},{"at":5.82,"kind":"text","text":"Today: check what it tells you calmly"},{"at":10.73,"kind":"text","text":"That habit keeps you in charge"}]},{"at":13.13,"heading":"AI can sound certain","items":[{"at":13.28,"kind":"term","text":"Confident but wrong","detail":"AI can be wrong and still sound certain"},{"at":16.4,"kind":"text","text":"Invented facts, dates, numbers, quotes, links"},{"at":26.01,"kind":"text","text":"You stay responsible for what you use"},{"at":28.69,"kind":"term","text":"Step 1: importance","detail":"Ask how much it matters; verify health, law, money, safety, work"}]},{"at":35.76,"heading":"Check routine","items":[{"at":35.91,"kind":"term","text":"Step 2: trusted source","detail":"Check key facts; textbook, official site, teacher, 2 sources"},{"at":44.33,"kind":"term","text":"Step 3: working","detail":"Ask for step-by-step working; check each step, especially maths"},{"at":50.76,"kind":"term","text":"Step 4: sources","detail":"Ask for sources; open them yourself; unfindable source does not count"},{"at":56.9,"kind":"term","text":"Step 5: challenge","detail":"Ask what might be wrong; ask again in new chat and compare"},{"at":62.32,"kind":"term","text":"Step 6: old info","detail":"Watch for old information after the model's knowledge cut-off"}]},{"at":70.42,"heading":"Privacy rule","items":[{"at":70.57,"kind":"text","text":"One more rule protects you and others"},{"at":73.18,"kind":"text","text":"Do not paste passwords, ID numbers, private details"},{"at":79.32,"kind":"text","text":"Keep personal information out"}]},{"at":83.99,"heading":"Worked example","items":[{"at":84.14,"kind":"text","text":"Model says a historical event happened in a year"},{"at":88.03,"kind":"text","text":"It gives a book title as its source"},{"at":90.61,"kind":"text","text":"Check an encyclopaedia"},{"at":92.25,"kind":"text","text":"Year is right; book does not exist"},{"at":99.88,"kind":"text","text":"Keep the fact; cite the encyclopaedia; drop the fake book"}]},{"at":101.83,"heading":"Quick check","items":[{"at":101.83,"kind":"question","text":"An AI solves a maths problem and gives you an answer. What are two ways to check it?"}]},{"at":111.48,"heading":"Answer","items":[{"at":111.63,"kind":"text","text":"Work it yourself; check each step"},{"at":116.06,"kind":"text","text":"Substitute answer; calculator; textbook"},{"at":121.31,"kind":"text","text":"A second method catches missed errors"}]},{"at":125.1,"heading":"Mistake 1: copying","items":[{"at":125.25,"kind":"wrong","text":"Copying without reading"}]},{"at":132.64,"heading":"Mistakes 2 & 3","items":[{"at":135.89,"kind":"wrong","text":"Trusting invented references"},{"at":145.19,"kind":"wrong","text":"Asking same chat 'are you sure' = proof"}]},{"at":152.65,"heading":"Recap","items":[{"at":152.8,"kind":"text","text":"AI can sound certain and still be wrong"},{"at":156.32,"kind":"text","text":"Check what matters in trusted sources; open sources"},{"at":160.65,"kind":"text","text":"Ask for working; test answer; protect private details"},{"at":165.11,"kind":"tip","text":"Top tip: if you cannot find the source, do not cite it"},{"at":169.01,"kind":"text","text":"Knowzone: calm, careful habits with AI"}]}],"check":{"at":111.13,"seconds":10,"question":"An AI solves a maths problem and gives you an answer. What are two ways to check it?","answer":"Work the problem yourself; check each step; substitute the answer; use a calculator; compare with textbook."},"fps":30,"mouth":"","level":"","credits":[],"voice":"qwen3-tts-12hz-1.7b (cloned voice)"}